sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(241, 248, 255) Host and host-owned persistence
    participant Outbox as Private shared outbox
    participant Worker as Host outbox worker
    participant HostPolicy as Fresh host policy
    participant Family as Family sequencer
    participant Log as Working log
    participant Reconcile as Late checkpoint reconciler
    participant Notes as Authorship notes
    end

    Note over Outbox,Worker: Later, after the host daemon owns its lock
    Worker->>Outbox: Claim bounded oldest-ready batch
    Worker->>Worker: Validate owner, mode, links, schema, instance, paths, size, and ordering

    alt Record is malformed, hostile, expired, or namespace mismatched
        Worker->>Outbox: Reject or quarantine for a bounded time
        Worker->>Worker: Record redacted diagnostic
    else Record is structurally valid
        Worker->>Worker: Check completed delivery ID

        alt Delivery ID was already applied
            Worker->>Outbox: Mark complete and remove ready record
        else Delivery is not completed
            Worker->>HostPolicy: Re-resolve repository and apply current allowlist

            alt Repository is now denied
                HostPolicy-->>Worker: Denied
                Worker->>Outbox: Delete payload and retain redacted status
            else Repository remains allowed
                HostPolicy-->>Worker: Allowed
                Worker->>Worker: Classify causal state

                alt Base is current or commit processing has not won the race
                    Worker->>Family: ingest_checkpoint_delivery(envelope) with capture ordering
                    Family->>Log: Idempotently apply checkpoint and delivery ID
                    Log-->>Family: Durable success
                    Family-->>Worker: Applied
                    Worker->>Outbox: Mark complete and remove ready record
                else One processed direct child is exactly provable
                    Worker->>Reconcile: Base, child, blobs, and existing note
                    Reconcile->>Notes: Update only unknown lines
                    Note over Reconcile,Notes: Preserve known attribution and prompt/session metadata
                    Notes-->>Reconcile: Durable success
                    Reconcile-->>Worker: Applied
                    Worker->>Outbox: Mark complete and remove ready record
                else History, blobs, note, or ordering is ambiguous
                    Worker->>Outbox: Mark needs_reconciliation
                    Worker->>Worker: Record redacted diagnostic and do not guess
                end
            end
        end
    end
